      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Absolutely agree with this. This is a free offering and should absolutely be available until it makes absolutely no more sense to do so. Which should be a long time from now. \n\nWhen I saw it was on a timer, it gave me a bad impression. I don't see any reason why this should expire. I get it's suicide awareness/prevention month but peoples mental health is FOREVER. Don't leave this on a timer. It doesn't look good to me seeing this just after the last pride charity event. The way it comes off is the same kind of corporate \"look at the good we want to make it look like we're doing\" instead of just doing good because it's what you outa do.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
